@9000 = ~Give me Snow Leopard Charm, Lucky Coin of Tymora, Deep Red Ioun Stone and Amulet of Protection +1, a Permanency Scroll, 50,000 gold pieces and Cespenar will see what can be done. What does youse say?~

@9001 = ~Does youse want a shiny dagger? With a +3 dagger, Heart of the Golem +2, Stiletto of Demarchess +2, The Grave Binder +2 and Neb's Nasty Cutter, Cespenar will forge a very powerful weapon, but it will only be usable by thieves. Cespenar will also need a Manual of Elaboration. It will cost 75,000 gold pieces for youse. Are we ready?~

@9002 = ~Does youse need better shoes? Cespenar can combine Boots of The Woodland with a pair of boots of speed and three scrolls of Improved Haste into a pair of boots which will make any ranger who wears them swing faster. Cespenar also needs a Permanency Scroll to make sure that the effect will not gradually fade. It will cost youse 50,000 gold pieces. Are we ready to proceed?~

@9003 = ~Ooo! It is unbelievable! Haves youse found the lost tome of Elven Legacy? It can be used to make an extraordinary potion for any Elf or Half Elf. Unfortunately, it has some missed words, but with the help of a Manual of Elaboration Cespenar can fill the blanks. Youse must give Cespenar two King's Tears and 50,000 gold pieces, too. Does youse like this recipe?~

@9004 = ~Cespenar can combine Shadow Armor, The Night's Gift and Armor of Deep Night together into a mighty suit of armor for a thief. Cespenar will also need three Horn Coral Gems, a spirit Armor scroll, Ring of Duplication, Destroyer of the Hills belt and a Permanency Scroll to complete the task. It will cost youse 75,000 gold pieces because it's not an easy job. Must I need to get started?~

@9005 = ~Cespenar can combine Night Club, Backwhacker and Sure Strike Club together into a mighty strong club. I will also need a Permanency Scroll to complete the task. It will cost 60,000 gold pieces for youse. Are we ready?~

@9006 = ~Ooo! You gots four heads, and I can add the final head. Real shocker, that one. 75,000 gp and I do it okay. You want?~
